#: bin/soundconverter.py.in:124
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Convert in batch mode, from the command line, without a graphical user "
"interface. You can use this from, say, shell scripts."
msgstr ""
"Konvertuoti komandų veiksenoje, iš komandinės eilutės, be grafinės\n"
"naudotojo sąsajos. Tai galite naudoti, tarkime, apvalkalo scenarijuose."

#: bin/soundconverter.py.in:137
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Show tags for input files instead of converting them. This disables the "
"graphical user interface."
msgstr ""
"Vietoj to, kad konvertuoti įvesties failus, rodyti jų žymes. Tai nurodo \n"
"komandų eilutės komandų veikseną ir išjungia grafinę naudotojo sąsają."

#: bin/soundconverter.py.in:146
msgid "Displays additional debug information"
msgstr "Rodyti papildomą derinimo informaciją"

#: bin/soundconverter.py.in:156
msgid "Force number of concurrent conversions."
msgstr "Priverstinis lygiagrečių konvertavimų skaičius."

#: bin/soundconverter.py.in:163
msgid "Deletes the original file when conversion is done."
msgstr ""

#: bin/soundconverter.py.in:169
#, python-format
msgid "Resamples audio during conversion. Possible values: %(rates)s"
msgstr ""

#: bin/soundconverter.py.in:186
msgid ""
"Set the output format. aac/m4a, flac, mp3, ogg, opus and wav are supported."
msgstr ""

#: bin/soundconverter.py.in:197
msgid "One of cbr, abr or vbr (default) for mp3"
msgstr ""

#: bin/soundconverter.py.in:214
msgid "Go recursively into subdirectories"
msgstr ""

#: bin/soundconverter.py.in:224
msgid ""
"Put converted files into a different directory while rebuilding the original "
"directory structure. This includes the name of the original directory if a "
"directory was selected."
msgstr ""

#: bin/soundconverter.py.in:237
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"For example {artist}/{album}/{title}. title defaults to the filename if "
"unset. Unknown tags default to \"Unknown ...\" otherwise."
msgstr ""

#: bin/soundconverter.py.in:252
msgid ""
"Quality of the converted output file. Possible values: vorbis: 0.0 - 1.0; "
"aac/m4a: 0 - 400; opus: 6 - 510; mp3 vbr: 9 (low) - 0 (high); mp3 abr: 64 - "
"320; mp3 cbr: 64 - 320; wav: 8, 16, 32 (bitdepth); flac: 0 - 8 (compression "
"strength)"
msgstr ""

